              Forward webhooks directly into your local development server (<code class="font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">http://localhost:3000</code> or <code class="font-mono text-slate-800 dark:text-zinc-200">http://localhost:8000</code>) using standard Server-Sent Events. No paid tunnels, no ngrok binary, and no port forwarding required:
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-4">
              <!-- Node.js Script -->
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-slate-900 dark:bg-[#0b0f19] overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-800/80 dark:bg-[#111625] border-b border-slate-700/60 dark:border-zinc-800 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 inline-block"></span>
                    <span>Node.js / TypeScript Local Forwarder</span>
                  </span>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="copy-code-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:hover:bg-zinc-700 text-slate-200 text-[11px] font-mono transition-colors cursor-pointer border border-slate-600/60 dark:border-zinc-700"
                    data-code={nodeForwarderScript}
                  >
                    Copy
                  </button>
                </div>
                <pre class="p-4 text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><code>{nodeForwarderScript}</code></pre>
              </div>

              <!-- Python Script -->
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-slate-900 dark:bg-[#0b0f19] overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-800/80 dark:bg-[#111625] border-b border-slate-700/60 dark:border-zinc-800 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-400 inline-block"></span>
                    <span>Python Local Forwarder (requests + sseclient)</span>
                  </span>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="copy-code-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:hover:bg-zinc-700 text-slate-200 text-[11px] font-mono transition-colors cursor-pointer border border-slate-600/60 dark:border-zinc-700"
                    data-code={pythonForwarderScript}
                  >
                    Copy
                  </button>
