              SafeWebhook automatically inspects signature headers from Stripe, GitHub, Shopify, Slack, Twilio, and Svix. Below is the production-ready Node.js constant-time verification recipe:
            </p>

            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-slate-900 dark:bg-[#0b0f19] overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2.5 bg-slate-800/80 dark:bg-[#111625] border-b border-slate-700/60 dark:border-zinc-800 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
